window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a474-1a069138a613bf4f.json"]={sha256:"1a069138a613bf4f0882c706d074a6d30317f8e8f85fe772217c38c216d2ee17",value:{"id":"a474","title":"電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機","titleEn":"Radio-telescope low-noise receivers","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 ALMA 前端（4 K SIS 混頻器與 15 K 低溫 HEMT 中頻放大器）與綠堤 100 m 望遠鏡（GBT）的公分波接收機為對象，從輻射計方程與 SEFD 出發，拆解饋源照明、Friis 雜訊級聯、量子雜訊極限、Y 因子校正、Allan 變異數與低溫恆溫器整合，最後落到接收機驗收與交接。","summaryEn":"Using the ALMA front end (4 K SIS mixers with 15 K cryogenic HEMT IF amplifiers) and the centimetre-wave receivers of the 100 m Green Bank Telescope as reference designs, the course starts from the radiometer equation and SEFD and works through feed illumination, the Friis noise cascade, the quantum noise limit, Y-factor calibration, Allan variance and cryostat integration, ending with receiver acceptance and handoff.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-astronomical","subcategoryTitle":"天文儀器與科學感測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Astronomical instrumentation and scientific sensors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-astronomical","learningTags":["optics","optics-astronomical","radio"],"architectureFamily":"radio","architectureNodes":[["天線與副反射鏡","Antenna and subreflector"],["饋源喇叭與正交模轉換器","Feed horn and orthomode transducer"],["SIS 混頻器與本振","SIS mixer and local oscillator"],["低溫 HEMT 中頻放大器","Cryogenic HEMT IF amplifier"],["校正負載與雜訊二極體","Calibration loads and noise diode"],["低溫恆溫器與數位化後端","Cryostat and digitising back end"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,5],[4,1],[5,2]],"diagram":{"type":"radio","labels":["天線與副反射鏡","饋源喇叭與正交模轉換器","SIS 混頻器與本振","低溫 HEMT 中頻放大器","校正負載與雜訊二極體"],"labelsEn":["Antenna and subreflector","Feed horn and orthomode transducer","SIS mixer and local oscillator","Cryogenic HEMT IF amplifier","Calibration loads and noise diode"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"雜訊鏈練習：假設饋源與正交模轉換器在 15 K、損耗 0.3 dB（L = 1.072），第一級低溫 HEMT T₁ = 3 K、G₁ = 35 dB（3162），第二級室溫放大器 T₂ = 150 K。前端損耗貢獻 (L−1)×15 = 1.08 K，Friis 級聯 T_rx = 1.08 + 1.072×(3 + 150/3162) = 1.08 + 3.27 = 4.35 K。加上天空 5 K、地面溢出 3 K、宇宙微波背景 2.7 K，Tsys ≈ 15 K。對 GBT（A_eff ≈ 5500 m²）SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×15/5500 = 7.5e−26 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ = 7.5 Jy；以 B = 100 MHz、τ = 60 s 積分，流量靈敏度 ΔS = 7.5/√(1e8×60) = 97 µJy。若前端損耗增加到 1 dB（L = 1.259），T_rx 升到 3.9 + 1.259×3.05 = 7.7 K，Tsys 變成約 18 K，相同靈敏度需要的時間增加 (18/15)² = 1.44 倍。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Noise-chain exercise: assume the feed and orthomode transducer at 15 K with 0.3 dB loss (L = 1.072), a first-stage cryogenic HEMT with T₁ = 3 K and G₁ = 35 dB (3162), and a room-temperature second stage with T₂ = 150 K. The front-end loss contributes (L−1)×15 = 1.08 K and the Friis cascade gives T_rx = 1.08 + 1.072×(3 + 150/3162) = 1.08 + 3.27 = 4.35 K. Adding 5 K of sky, 3 K of ground spillover and 2.7 K of cosmic microwave background gives Tsys ≈ 15 K. For the GBT (A_eff ≈ 5500 m²) SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×15/5500 = 7.5e−26 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ = 7.5 Jy; integrating B = 100 MHz for τ = 60 s gives a flux sensitivity ΔS = 7.5/√(1e8×60) = 97 µJy. If the front-end loss grows to 1 dB (L = 1.259), T_rx rises to 3.9 + 1.259×3.05 = 7.7 K, Tsys becomes about 18 K and the time for the same sensitivity grows by (18/15)² = 1.44. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a474-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD」與「饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD\" and \"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a474-v12-01","title":"輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “System noise temperature Tsys” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"電波望遠鏡收到的天體訊號本身就是雜訊狀的隨機電壓，功率為 P = k·T·B·G；系統雜訊溫度 Tsys 把天空、地面溢出與接收機本身的貢獻加總成一個等效溫度。輻射計方程 ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) 說明靈敏度只能靠降低 Tsys、加寬頻寬或拉長積分時間；把天線有效面積一起考慮，系統等效流量密度 SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff 就是接收機與天線合起來的靈敏度指標，單位是 Jy。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The signal a radio telescope collects is itself a noise-like random voltage with power P = k·T·B·G; the system noise temperature Tsys lumps sky, ground spillover and the receiver into one equivalent temperature. The radiometer equation ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) shows that sensitivity improves only through lower Tsys, wider bandwidth or longer integration; folding in the antenna effective area, the system equivalent flux density SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff is the combined antenna-plus-receiver sensitivity figure in Jy. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “System noise temperature Tsys”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：綠堤望遠鏡口徑 100 m、孔徑效率取 0.7 時，有效面積 A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²；L 波段系統雜訊溫度 Tsys = 20 K 時 SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For the 100 m GBT with aperture efficiency 0.7, A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²; at L band with Tsys = 20 K, SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy.","failure":"常見誤解：「雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “System noise temperature Tsys”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-01-k1","title":"輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD","titleEn":"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD","text":"電波望遠鏡收到的天體訊號本身就是雜訊狀的隨機電壓，功率為 P = k·T·B·G；系統雜訊溫度 Tsys 把天空、地面溢出與接收機本身的貢獻加總成一個等效溫度。輻射計方程 ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) 說明靈敏度只能靠降低 Tsys、加寬頻寬或拉長積分時間；把天線有效面積一起考慮，系統等效流量密度 SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff 就是接收機與天線合起來的靈敏度指標，單位是 Jy。","textEn":"The signal a radio telescope collects is itself a noise-like random voltage with power P = k·T·B·G; the system noise temperature Tsys lumps sky, ground spillover and the receiver into one equivalent temperature. The radiometer equation ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) shows that sensitivity improves only through lower Tsys, wider bandwidth or longer integration; folding in the antenna effective area, the system equivalent flux density SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff is the combined antenna-plus-receiver sensitivity figure in Jy.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD\" is correct?","options":["雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","電波望遠鏡收到的天體訊號本身就是雜訊狀的隨機電壓，功率為 P = k·T·B·G；系統雜訊溫度 Tsys 把天空、地面溢出與接收機本身的貢獻加總成一個等效溫度。","把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","The signal a radio telescope collects is itself a noise-like random voltage with power P = k·T·B·G.","The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"電波望遠鏡收到的天體訊號本身就是雜訊狀的隨機電壓，功率為 P = k·T·B·G；系統雜訊溫度 Tsys 把天空、地面溢出與接收機本身的貢獻加總成一個等效溫度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The signal a radio telescope collects is itself a noise-like random voltage with power P = k·T·B·G; the system noise temperature Tsys lumps sky, ground spillover and the receiver into one equivalent temperature. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a474-v12-02","title":"輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD：定量估算","titleEn":"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “System noise temperature Tsys” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：綠堤望遠鏡口徑 100 m、孔徑效率取 0.7 時，有效面積 A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²；L 波段系統雜訊溫度 Tsys = 20 K 時 SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy。取頻寬 B = 1 MHz、積分時間 τ = 1 s，溫度靈敏度 ΔT = 20/√1e6 = 0.02 K，對應的流量靈敏度 ΔS = SEFD/√(Bτ) = 10 mJy。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For the 100 m GBT with aperture efficiency 0.7, A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²; at L band with Tsys = 20 K, SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy. With B = 1 MHz and τ = 1 s, ΔT = 20/√1e6 = 0.02 K, a flux sensitivity ΔS = SEFD/√(Bτ) = 10 mJy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用校正過的雜訊二極體或熱／冷負載量出 Tsys，再對一個無源天區做總功率積分，檢查量到的雜訊隨積分時間以 1/√τ 下降，直到增益漲落接管為止；把量到的 ΔT 與輻射計方程預測值比較，差異應在 10–20% 內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure Tsys with a calibrated noise diode or hot/cold loads, then integrate total power on a source-free patch of sky and check that the measured noise falls as 1/√τ until gain fluctuations take over; compare the measured ΔT with the radiometer-equation prediction, which should agree within 10–20%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"綠堤望遠鏡口徑 100 m、孔徑效率取 0.7 時，有效面積 A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²；L 波段系統雜訊溫度 Tsys = 20 K 時 SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy。取頻寬 B = 1 MHz、積分時間 τ = 1 s，溫度靈敏度 ΔT = 20/√1e6 = 0.02 K，對應的流量靈敏度 ΔS = SEFD/√(Bτ) = 10 mJy。","textEn":"For the 100 m GBT with aperture efficiency 0.7, A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²; at L band with Tsys = 20 K, SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy. With B = 1 MHz and τ = 1 s, ΔT = 20/√1e6 = 0.02 K, a flux sensitivity ΔS = SEFD/√(Bτ) = 10 mJy.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD\", which statement holds?","options":["混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。","積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。","綠堤望遠鏡口徑 100 m、孔徑效率取 0.7 時，有效面積 A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²。"],"optionsEn":["Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.","Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.","For the 100 m GBT with aperture efficiency 0.7, A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²; at L band with Tsys = 20 K, SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy."],"answer":2,"explanation":"綠堤望遠鏡口徑 100 m、孔徑效率取 0.7 時，有效面積 A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²；L 波段系統雜訊溫度 Tsys = 20 K 時 SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For the 100 m GBT with aperture efficiency 0.7, A_eff = 0.7·π·50² ≈ 5500 m²; at L band with Tsys = 20 K, SEFD = 2×1.38e−23×20/5500 = 1.0e−25 W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 10 Jy. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a474-v12-03","title":"輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “System noise temperature Tsys” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用校正過的雜訊二極體或熱／冷負載量出 Tsys，再對一個無源天區做總功率積分，檢查量到的雜訊隨積分時間以 1/√τ 下降，直到增益漲落接管為止；把量到的 ΔT 與輻射計方程預測值比較，差異應在 10–20% 內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure Tsys with a calibrated noise diode or hot/cold loads, then integrate total power on a source-free patch of sky and check that the measured noise falls as 1/√τ until gain fluctuations take over; compare the measured ΔT with the radiometer-equation prediction, which should agree within 10–20%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若接收機增益有 ΔG/G = 1e−3 的漲落，等效雜訊下限為 Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK，在 Bτ = 1e6 時就與輻射計雜訊相等；再積分也不會更好，必須改用 Dicke 切換或頻率切換。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A gain fluctuation ΔG/G = 1e−3 sets an equivalent noise floor of Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK, equal to the radiometer noise already at Bτ = 1e6; further integration does not help, and Dicke or frequency switching becomes necessary.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用校正過的雜訊二極體或熱／冷負載量出 Tsys，再對一個無源天區做總功率積分，檢查量到的雜訊隨積分時間以 1/√τ 下降，直到增益漲落接管為止；把量到的 ΔT 與輻射計方程預測值比較，差異應在 10–20% 內。","textEn":"Measure Tsys with a calibrated noise diode or hot/cold loads, then integrate total power on a source-free patch of sky and check that the measured noise falls as 1/√τ until gain fluctuations take over; compare the measured ΔT with the radiometer-equation prediction, which should agree within 10–20%.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD\"?","options":["用校正過的雜訊二極體或熱／冷負載量出 Tsys，再對一個無源天區做總功率積分，檢查量到的雜訊隨積分時間以 1/√τ 下降，直到增益漲落接管為止。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。"],"optionsEn":["Measure Tsys with a calibrated noise diode or hot/cold loads, then integrate total power on a source-free patch of sky and check that the measured noise falls as 1/√τ until gain fluctuations take over.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用校正過的雜訊二極體或熱／冷負載量出 Tsys，再對一個無源天區做總功率積分，檢查量到的雜訊隨積分時間以 1/√τ 下降，直到增益漲落接管為止；把量到的 ΔT 與輻射計方程預測值比較，差異應在 10–20% 內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure Tsys with a calibrated noise diode or hot/cold loads, then integrate total power on a source-free patch of sky and check that the measured noise falls as 1/√τ until gain fluctuations take over; compare the measured ΔT with the radiometer-equation prediction, which should agree within 10–20%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a474-v12-04","title":"輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD：失效診斷","titleEn":"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「系統雜訊溫度 Tsys」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “System noise temperature Tsys” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若接收機增益有 ΔG/G = 1e−3 的漲落，等效雜訊下限為 Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK，在 Bτ = 1e6 時就與輻射計雜訊相等；再積分也不會更好，必須改用 Dicke 切換或頻率切換。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A gain fluctuation ΔG/G = 1e−3 sets an equivalent noise floor of Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK, equal to the radiometer noise already at Bτ = 1e6; further integration does not help, and Dicke or frequency switching becomes necessary. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：輻射計方程 ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) 說明靈敏度只能靠降低 Tsys、加寬頻寬或拉長積分時間；把天線有效面積一起考慮，系統等效流量密度 SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff 就是接收機與天線合起來的靈敏度指標，單位是 Jy。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The radiometer equation ΔT = Tsys/√(B·τ) shows that sensitivity improves only through lower Tsys, wider bandwidth or longer integration; folding in the antenna effective area, the system equivalent flux density SEFD = 2k·Tsys/A_eff is the combined antenna-plus-receiver sensitivity figure in Jy.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若接收機增益有 ΔG/G = 1e−3 的漲落，等效雜訊下限為 Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK，在 Bτ = 1e6 時就與輻射計雜訊相等；再積分也不會更好，必須改用 Dicke 切換或頻率切換。","textEn":"A gain fluctuation ΔG/G = 1e−3 sets an equivalent noise floor of Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK, equal to the radiometer noise already at Bτ = 1e6; further integration does not help, and Dicke or frequency switching becomes necessary.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「輻射計方程、Tsys 與 SEFD」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Radiometer equation, Tsys and SEFD\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若接收機增益有 ΔG/G = 1e−3 的漲落，等效雜訊下限為 Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK，在 Bτ = 1e6 時就與輻射計雜訊相等。","把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A gain fluctuation ΔG/G = 1e−3 sets an equivalent noise floor of Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK, equal to the radiometer noise already at Bτ = 1e6.","The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若接收機增益有 ΔG/G = 1e−3 的漲落，等效雜訊下限為 Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK，在 Bτ = 1e6 時就與輻射計雜訊相等；再積分也不會更好，必須改用 Dicke 切換或頻率切換。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A gain fluctuation ΔG/G = 1e−3 sets an equivalent noise floor of Tsys×1e−3 = 20 mK, equal to the radiometer noise already at Bτ = 1e6; further integration does not help, and Dicke or frequency switching becomes necessary. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a474-v12-05","title":"饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「波紋饋源喇叭」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Corrugated feed horn” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"波紋饋源喇叭產生近似高斯的對稱波束去照明副反射鏡，邊緣照明強度（edge taper）決定了兩個互相拉扯的效率：照明越均勻，照明效率越高，但從副鏡邊緣溢出的能量也越多；溢出的波束若看到 280 K 的地面，就直接把地面雜訊加進 Tsys。總孔徑效率還要乘上表面精度造成的 Ruze 因子與遮擋損失，所以毫米波望遠鏡的面板精度與饋源設計是一體考慮的。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「波紋饋源喇叭」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A corrugated feed horn produces a nearly Gaussian symmetric beam that illuminates the subreflector, and the edge taper sets two competing efficiencies: a flatter illumination raises illumination efficiency but spills more power past the subreflector edge, and spillover that sees the 280 K ground adds ground noise straight into Tsys. The total aperture efficiency is further multiplied by the Ruze factor from surface accuracy and by blockage, so panel accuracy and feed design of a millimetre telescope are considered together. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Corrugated feed horn”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Ruze 表面效率因子 η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：ALMA 12 m 天線的表面精度 ε = 25 µm，在 Band 7（λ = 0.87 mm）時 η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88，在 Band 9（λ = 0.45 mm）時降到 0.61。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Ruze factor η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]: with the 25 µm surface accuracy of an ALMA 12 m antenna, η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88 at Band 7 (λ = 0.87 mm) and drops to 0.61 at Band 9 (λ = 0.45 mm).","failure":"常見誤解：「把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「波紋饋源喇叭」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Corrugated feed horn”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-05-k1","title":"饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率","titleEn":"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency","text":"波紋饋源喇叭產生近似高斯的對稱波束去照明副反射鏡，邊緣照明強度（edge taper）決定了兩個互相拉扯的效率：照明越均勻，照明效率越高，但從副鏡邊緣溢出的能量也越多；溢出的波束若看到 280 K 的地面，就直接把地面雜訊加進 Tsys。總孔徑效率還要乘上表面精度造成的 Ruze 因子與遮擋損失，所以毫米波望遠鏡的面板精度與饋源設計是一體考慮的。","textEn":"A corrugated feed horn produces a nearly Gaussian symmetric beam that illuminates the subreflector, and the edge taper sets two competing efficiencies: a flatter illumination raises illumination efficiency but spills more power past the subreflector edge, and spillover that sees the 280 K ground adds ground noise straight into Tsys. The total aperture efficiency is further multiplied by the Ruze factor from surface accuracy and by blockage, so panel accuracy and feed design of a millimetre telescope are considered together.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency\" is correct?","options":["把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。","波紋饋源喇叭產生近似高斯的對稱波束去照明副反射鏡，邊緣照明強度（edge taper）決定了兩個互相拉扯的效率：照明越均勻，照明效率越高，但從副鏡邊緣溢出的能量也越多。"],"optionsEn":["The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency.","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.","A corrugated feed horn produces a nearly Gaussian symmetric beam that illuminates the subreflector, and the edge taper sets two competing efficiencies: a flatter illumination raises illumination efficiency but spills more power past the subreflector edge, and spillover that sees the 280 K ground adds ground noise straight into Tsys."],"answer":2,"explanation":"波紋饋源喇叭產生近似高斯的對稱波束去照明副反射鏡，邊緣照明強度（edge taper）決定了兩個互相拉扯的效率：照明越均勻，照明效率越高，但從副鏡邊緣溢出的能量也越多；溢出的波束若看到 280 K 的地面，就直接把地面雜訊加進 Tsys。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A corrugated feed horn produces a nearly Gaussian symmetric beam that illuminates the subreflector, and the edge taper sets two competing efficiencies: a flatter illumination raises illumination efficiency but spills more power past the subreflector edge, and spillover that sees the 280 K ground adds ground noise straight into Tsys. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a474-v12-06","title":"饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率：定量估算","titleEn":"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波紋饋源喇叭」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Corrugated feed horn” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Ruze 表面效率因子 η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：ALMA 12 m 天線的表面精度 ε = 25 µm，在 Band 7（λ = 0.87 mm）時 η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88，在 Band 9（λ = 0.45 mm）時降到 0.61。若饋源有 2% 的波束溢出到 280 K 的地面，加入系統雜訊溫度的量為 0.02×280 = 5.6 K。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Ruze factor η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]: with the 25 µm surface accuracy of an ALMA 12 m antenna, η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88 at Band 7 (λ = 0.87 mm) and drops to 0.61 at Band 9 (λ = 0.45 mm). If 2% of the feed beam spills onto 280 K ground, the noise added to Tsys is 0.02×280 = 5.6 K. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在近場天線量測場量饋源波束方向圖與邊緣照明；上望遠鏡後用亮度溫度已知的行星量孔徑效率，在數個頻率重複，把效率對頻率的曲線用 Ruze 公式擬合出等效表面誤差 ε，與全像法（holography）量到的面板誤差比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the feed beam pattern and edge taper on a near-field antenna range; on the telescope, measure aperture efficiency with planets of known brightness temperature at several frequencies and fit the efficiency-versus-frequency curve with the Ruze formula to extract an equivalent surface error ε, then compare it with the panel errors from holography.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Ruze 表面效率因子 η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：ALMA 12 m 天線的表面精度 ε = 25 µm，在 Band 7（λ = 0.87 mm）時 η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88，在 Band 9（λ = 0.45 mm）時降到 0.61。若饋源有 2% 的波束溢出到 280 K 的地面，加入系統雜訊溫度的量為 0.02×280 = 5.6 K。","textEn":"Ruze factor η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]: with the 25 µm surface accuracy of an ALMA 12 m antenna, η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88 at Band 7 (λ = 0.87 mm) and drops to 0.61 at Band 9 (λ = 0.45 mm). If 2% of the feed beam spills onto 280 K ground, the noise added to Tsys is 0.02×280 = 5.6 K.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency\", which statement holds?","options":["Ruze 表面效率因子 η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：ALMA 12 m 天線的表面精度 ε = 25 µm，在 Band 7（λ = 0.87 mm）時 η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88，在 Band 9（λ = 0.45 mm）時降到 0.61。","雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。","真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。"],"optionsEn":["Ruze factor η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]: with the 25 µm surface accuracy of an ALMA 12 m antenna, η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88 at Band 7 (λ = 0.87 mm) and drops to 0.61 at Band 9 (λ = 0.45 mm).","Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever.","A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Ruze 表面效率因子 η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：ALMA 12 m 天線的表面精度 ε = 25 µm，在 Band 7（λ = 0.87 mm）時 η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88，在 Band 9（λ = 0.45 mm）時降到 0.61。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Ruze factor η_surf = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]: with the 25 µm surface accuracy of an ALMA 12 m antenna, η_surf = exp[−(0.361)²] = 0.88 at Band 7 (λ = 0.87 mm) and drops to 0.61 at Band 9 (λ = 0.45 mm). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a474-v12-07","title":"饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「波紋饋源喇叭」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Corrugated feed horn” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在近場天線量測場量饋源波束方向圖與邊緣照明；上望遠鏡後用亮度溫度已知的行星量孔徑效率，在數個頻率重複，把效率對頻率的曲線用 Ruze 公式擬合出等效表面誤差 ε，與全像法（holography）量到的面板誤差比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the feed beam pattern and edge taper on a near-field antenna range; on the telescope, measure aperture efficiency with planets of known brightness temperature at several frequencies and fit the efficiency-versus-frequency curve with the Ruze formula to extract an equivalent surface error ε, then compare it with the panel errors from holography. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：饋源相位中心沒有放在副鏡焦點時，波束出現離焦與高旁瓣，增益下降且溢出雜訊增加；真空窗內若結露或結霜，損耗在饋源之前發生，每 0.1 dB 損耗在室溫下就加入約 7 K 雜訊。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A feed phase centre not placed at the subreflector focus defocuses the beam and raises sidelobes, lowering gain and increasing spillover noise; condensation or frost inside the vacuum window adds loss ahead of the feed, and every 0.1 dB of room-temperature loss adds about 7 K of noise.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在近場天線量測場量饋源波束方向圖與邊緣照明；上望遠鏡後用亮度溫度已知的行星量孔徑效率，在數個頻率重複，把效率對頻率的曲線用 Ruze 公式擬合出等效表面誤差 ε，與全像法（holography）量到的面板誤差比較。","textEn":"Measure the feed beam pattern and edge taper on a near-field antenna range; on the telescope, measure aperture efficiency with planets of known brightness temperature at several frequencies and fit the efficiency-versus-frequency curve with the Ruze formula to extract an equivalent surface error ε, then compare it with the panel errors from holography.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在近場天線量測場量饋源波束方向圖與邊緣照明。","通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure the feed beam pattern and edge taper on a near-field antenna range.","Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在近場天線量測場量饋源波束方向圖與邊緣照明；上望遠鏡後用亮度溫度已知的行星量孔徑效率，在數個頻率重複，把效率對頻率的曲線用 Ruze 公式擬合出等效表面誤差 ε，與全像法（holography）量到的面板誤差比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the feed beam pattern and edge taper on a near-field antenna range; on the telescope, measure aperture efficiency with planets of known brightness temperature at several frequencies and fit the efficiency-versus-frequency curve with the Ruze formula to extract an equivalent surface error ε, then compare it with the panel errors from holography. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a474-v12-08","title":"饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波紋饋源喇叭」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Corrugated feed horn” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"饋源相位中心沒有放在副鏡焦點時，波束出現離焦與高旁瓣，增益下降且溢出雜訊增加；真空窗內若結露或結霜，損耗在饋源之前發生，每 0.1 dB 損耗在室溫下就加入約 7 K 雜訊。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A feed phase centre not placed at the subreflector focus defocuses the beam and raises sidelobes, lowering gain and increasing spillover noise; condensation or frost inside the vacuum window adds loss ahead of the feed, and every 0.1 dB of room-temperature loss adds about 7 K of noise. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：總孔徑效率還要乘上表面精度造成的 Ruze 因子與遮擋損失，所以毫米波望遠鏡的面板精度與饋源設計是一體考慮的。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The total aperture efficiency is further multiplied by the Ruze factor from surface accuracy and by blockage, so panel accuracy and feed design of a millimetre telescope are considered together.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"饋源相位中心沒有放在副鏡焦點時，波束出現離焦與高旁瓣，增益下降且溢出雜訊增加；真空窗內若結露或結霜，損耗在饋源之前發生，每 0.1 dB 損耗在室溫下就加入約 7 K 雜訊。","textEn":"A feed phase centre not placed at the subreflector focus defocuses the beam and raises sidelobes, lowering gain and increasing spillover noise; condensation or frost inside the vacuum window adds loss ahead of the feed, and every 0.1 dB of room-temperature loss adds about 7 K of noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「饋源照明、溢出與孔徑效率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Feed illumination, spillover and aperture efficiency\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。","饋源相位中心沒有放在副鏡焦點時，波束出現離焦與高旁瓣，增益下降且溢出雜訊增加。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.","A feed phase centre not placed at the subreflector focus defocuses the beam and raises sidelobes, lowering gain and increasing spillover noise."],"answer":2,"explanation":"饋源相位中心沒有放在副鏡焦點時，波束出現離焦與高旁瓣，增益下降且溢出雜訊增加；真空窗內若結露或結霜，損耗在饋源之前發生，每 0.1 dB 損耗在室溫下就加入約 7 K 雜訊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A feed phase centre not placed at the subreflector focus defocuses the beam and raises sidelobes, lowering gain and increasing spillover noise; condensation or frost inside the vacuum window adds loss ahead of the feed, and every 0.1 dB of room-temperature loss adds about 7 K of noise. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a474-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯」與「SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade\" and \"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a474-v12-09","title":"HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"公分波與 ALMA 的中頻放大都靠 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器，冷到 4–15 K 時雜訊溫度可到幾個 K，增益 30–40 dB。Friis 公式 T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … 說明只要第一級增益夠高，後級雜訊就被壓到可以忽略；相反地，放在第一級之前的任何損耗 L 都把後面所有雜訊乘上 L，並自己加入 (L−1)·T_phys 的雜訊，因此饋源、正交模轉換器與波導必須做到最短、最冷。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Centimetre-wave front ends and the ALMA IF chains rely on InP HEMT low-noise amplifiers that reach a few kelvin of noise temperature with 30–40 dB gain when cooled to 4–15 K. The Friis formula T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … shows that with enough first-stage gain the later stages become negligible; conversely any loss L ahead of the first stage multiplies everything behind it by L and adds (L−1)·T_phys of its own, which is why the feed, orthomode transducer and waveguide must be as short and as cold as possible. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：第一級 LNA T₁ = 2 K、G₁ = 40 dB（10⁴），室溫第二級 T₂ = 100 K：T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A first-stage LNA with T₁ = 2 K and G₁ = 40 dB (10⁴) followed by a room-temperature stage with T₂ = 100 K gives T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K.","failure":"常見誤解：「增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-09-k1","title":"HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯","titleEn":"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade","text":"公分波與 ALMA 的中頻放大都靠 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器，冷到 4–15 K 時雜訊溫度可到幾個 K，增益 30–40 dB。Friis 公式 T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … 說明只要第一級增益夠高，後級雜訊就被壓到可以忽略；相反地，放在第一級之前的任何損耗 L 都把後面所有雜訊乘上 L，並自己加入 (L−1)·T_phys 的雜訊，因此饋源、正交模轉換器與波導必須做到最短、最冷。","textEn":"Centimetre-wave front ends and the ALMA IF chains rely on InP HEMT low-noise amplifiers that reach a few kelvin of noise temperature with 30–40 dB gain when cooled to 4–15 K. The Friis formula T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … shows that with enough first-stage gain the later stages become negligible; conversely any loss L ahead of the first stage multiplies everything behind it by L and adds (L−1)·T_phys of its own, which is why the feed, orthomode transducer and waveguide must be as short and as cold as possible.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade\" is correct?","options":["公分波與 ALMA 的中頻放大都靠 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器，冷到 4–15 K 時雜訊溫度可到幾個 K，增益 30–40 dB。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。","混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。"],"optionsEn":["Centimetre-wave front ends and the ALMA IF chains rely on InP HEMT low-noise amplifiers that reach a few kelvin of noise temperature with 30–40 dB gain when cooled to 4–15 K.","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.","Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"公分波與 ALMA 的中頻放大都靠 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器，冷到 4–15 K 時雜訊溫度可到幾個 K，增益 30–40 dB。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Centimetre-wave front ends and the ALMA IF chains rely on InP HEMT low-noise amplifiers that reach a few kelvin of noise temperature with 30–40 dB gain when cooled to 4–15 K. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a474-v12-10","title":"HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯：定量估算","titleEn":"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：第一級 LNA T₁ = 2 K、G₁ = 40 dB（10⁴），室溫第二級 T₂ = 100 K：T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K。若 LNA 前有 0.3 dB 損耗（L = 1.072）處於 20 K，則加入 (L−1)×20 = 1.4 K 且 LNA 雜訊變成 1.072×2 = 2.1 K，總接收機雜訊 ≈ 3.6 K——0.3 dB 的前端損耗讓雜訊幾乎加倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A first-stage LNA with T₁ = 2 K and G₁ = 40 dB (10⁴) followed by a room-temperature stage with T₂ = 100 K gives T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K. A 0.3 dB loss (L = 1.072) at 20 K ahead of the LNA adds (L−1)×20 = 1.4 K and scales the LNA noise to 1.072×2 = 2.1 K, so the receiver noise becomes ≈ 3.6 K: 0.3 dB of front-end loss nearly doubles the noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在低溫測試平台用冷衰減器法或熱／冷負載的 Y 因子法量 LNA 的雜訊溫度與增益對頻率曲線；掃描汲極電流找出最低雜訊的偏壓點；把各級量測值代入 Friis 公式，與整機量到的接收機雜訊比較，差額即為未計入的前端損耗。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: On a cryogenic test bench measure the LNA noise temperature and gain versus frequency by the cold-attenuator or hot/cold-load Y-factor method; sweep the drain current to find the minimum-noise bias point; insert the stage values into the Friis formula and compare with the receiver noise measured as a whole, the difference being unaccounted front-end loss.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"第一級 LNA T₁ = 2 K、G₁ = 40 dB（10⁴），室溫第二級 T₂ = 100 K：T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K。若 LNA 前有 0.3 dB 損耗（L = 1.072）處於 20 K，則加入 (L−1)×20 = 1.4 K 且 LNA 雜訊變成 1.072×2 = 2.1 K，總接收機雜訊 ≈ 3.6 K——0.3 dB 的前端損耗讓雜訊幾乎加倍。","textEn":"A first-stage LNA with T₁ = 2 K and G₁ = 40 dB (10⁴) followed by a room-temperature stage with T₂ = 100 K gives T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K. A 0.3 dB loss (L = 1.072) at 20 K ahead of the LNA adds (L−1)×20 = 1.4 K and scales the LNA noise to 1.072×2 = 2.1 K, so the receiver noise becomes ≈ 3.6 K: 0.3 dB of front-end loss nearly doubles the noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade\", which statement holds?","options":["積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。","第一級 LNA T₁ = 2 K、G₁ = 40 dB（10⁴），室溫第二級 T₂ = 100 K：T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K。","通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.","A first-stage LNA with T₁ = 2 K and G₁ = 40 dB (10⁴) followed by a room-temperature stage with T₂ = 100 K gives T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K.","Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope."],"answer":1,"explanation":"第一級 LNA T₁ = 2 K、G₁ = 40 dB（10⁴），室溫第二級 T₂ = 100 K：T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A first-stage LNA with T₁ = 2 K and G₁ = 40 dB (10⁴) followed by a room-temperature stage with T₂ = 100 K gives T_cas = 2 + 100/10⁴ = 2.01 K. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a474-v12-11","title":"HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯：量測與驗證","titleEn":"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在低溫測試平台用冷衰減器法或熱／冷負載的 Y 因子法量 LNA 的雜訊溫度與增益對頻率曲線；掃描汲極電流找出最低雜訊的偏壓點；把各級量測值代入 Friis 公式，與整機量到的接收機雜訊比較，差額即為未計入的前端損耗。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"On a cryogenic test bench measure the LNA noise temperature and gain versus frequency by the cold-attenuator or hot/cold-load Y-factor method; sweep the drain current to find the minimum-noise bias point; insert the stage values into the Friis formula and compare with the receiver noise measured as a whole, the difference being unaccounted front-end loss. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：HEMT 在低溫下增益上升，若輸入輸出隔離不足會在帶外振盪，表現為寬頻雜訊突升與增益不穩；汲極偏壓過高造成自熱，雜訊溫度隨時間緩慢上升。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: HEMT gain rises when cold, and with insufficient input–output isolation the amplifier oscillates out of band, showing up as a sudden broadband noise rise and unstable gain; too high a drain bias causes self-heating and the noise temperature creeps up with time.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在低溫測試平台用冷衰減器法或熱／冷負載的 Y 因子法量 LNA 的雜訊溫度與增益對頻率曲線；掃描汲極電流找出最低雜訊的偏壓點；把各級量測值代入 Friis 公式，與整機量到的接收機雜訊比較，差額即為未計入的前端損耗。","textEn":"On a cryogenic test bench measure the LNA noise temperature and gain versus frequency by the cold-attenuator or hot/cold-load Y-factor method; sweep the drain current to find the minimum-noise bias point; insert the stage values into the Friis formula and compare with the receiver noise measured as a whole, the difference being unaccounted front-end loss.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","在低溫測試平台用冷衰減器法或熱／冷負載的 Y 因子法量 LNA 的雜訊溫度與增益對頻率曲線。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","On a cryogenic test bench measure the LNA noise temperature and gain versus frequency by the cold-attenuator or hot/cold-load Y-factor method."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在低溫測試平台用冷衰減器法或熱／冷負載的 Y 因子法量 LNA 的雜訊溫度與增益對頻率曲線；掃描汲極電流找出最低雜訊的偏壓點；把各級量測值代入 Friis 公式，與整機量到的接收機雜訊比較，差額即為未計入的前端損耗。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"On a cryogenic test bench measure the LNA noise temperature and gain versus frequency by the cold-attenuator or hot/cold-load Y-factor method; sweep the drain current to find the minimum-noise bias point; insert the stage values into the Friis formula and compare with the receiver noise measured as a whole, the difference being unaccounted front-end loss. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a474-v12-12","title":"HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯：失效診斷","titleEn":"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「低溫 InP HEMT 低雜訊放大器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Cryogenic InP HEMT low-noise amplifier” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"HEMT 在低溫下增益上升，若輸入輸出隔離不足會在帶外振盪，表現為寬頻雜訊突升與增益不穩；汲極偏壓過高造成自熱，雜訊溫度隨時間緩慢上升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"HEMT gain rises when cold, and with insufficient input–output isolation the amplifier oscillates out of band, showing up as a sudden broadband noise rise and unstable gain; too high a drain bias causes self-heating and the noise temperature creeps up with time. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：Friis 公式 T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … 說明只要第一級增益夠高，後級雜訊就被壓到可以忽略；相反地，放在第一級之前的任何損耗 L 都把後面所有雜訊乘上 L，並自己加入 (L−1)·T_phys 的雜訊，因此饋源、正交模轉換器與波導必須做到最短、最冷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The Friis formula T_cas = T₁ + T₂/G₁ + T₃/(G₁G₂) + … shows that with enough first-stage gain the later stages become negligible; conversely any loss L ahead of the first stage multiplies everything behind it by L and adds (L−1)·T_phys of its own, which is why the feed, orthomode transducer and waveguide must be as short and as cold as possible.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"HEMT 在低溫下增益上升，若輸入輸出隔離不足會在帶外振盪，表現為寬頻雜訊突升與增益不穩；汲極偏壓過高造成自熱，雜訊溫度隨時間緩慢上升。","textEn":"HEMT gain rises when cold, and with insufficient input–output isolation the amplifier oscillates out of band, showing up as a sudden broadband noise rise and unstable gain; too high a drain bias causes self-heating and the noise temperature creeps up with time.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「HEMT 低雜訊放大器與 Friis 級聯」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"HEMT LNAs and the Friis noise cascade\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["HEMT 在低溫下增益上升，若輸入輸出隔離不足會在帶外振盪，表現為寬頻雜訊突升與增益不穩；汲極偏壓過高造成自熱，雜訊溫度隨時間緩慢上升。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。"],"optionsEn":["HEMT gain rises when cold, and with insufficient input–output isolation the amplifier oscillates out of band, showing up as a sudden broadband noise rise and unstable gain.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"HEMT 在低溫下增益上升，若輸入輸出隔離不足會在帶外振盪，表現為寬頻雜訊突升與增益不穩；汲極偏壓過高造成自熱，雜訊溫度隨時間緩慢上升。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"HEMT gain rises when cold, and with insufficient input–output isolation the amplifier oscillates out of band, showing up as a sudden broadband noise rise and unstable gain; too high a drain bias causes self-heating and the noise temperature creeps up with time. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a474-v12-13","title":"SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「SIS 混頻器與本振」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “SIS mixer and local oscillator” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"在 ALMA 的毫米／次毫米波段（84–950 GHz），HEMT 放大器的雜訊已不夠低，所以前端改用 4 K 的 Nb/AlOx/Nb 超導–絕緣–超導（SIS）穿隧接面當混頻器：本振光子協助電子穿隧，把天體訊號降頻到 4–12 GHz 的中頻，再交給低溫 HEMT 放大。SIS 混頻器的雜訊可以接近量子極限 hν/k，而 Nb 的能隙限制了可用頻率，更高頻段改用 NbTiN 電極；混頻器、本振耦合與中頻放大器都裝在同一個卡匣裡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「SIS 混頻器與本振」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In the ALMA millimetre and submillimetre bands (84–950 GHz) HEMT amplifiers are no longer quiet enough, so the front end uses 4 K Nb/AlOx/Nb superconductor–insulator–superconductor (SIS) tunnel junctions as mixers: local-oscillator photons assist electron tunnelling and the sky signal is down-converted to a 4–12 GHz IF that is then amplified by cryogenic HEMTs. SIS mixer noise can approach the quantum limit hν/k, and the niobium gap limits the usable frequency, so higher bands use NbTiN electrodes; mixer, LO coupling and IF amplifier sit together in one cartridge. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “SIS mixer and local oscillator”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：量子雜訊極限 hν/k：230 GHz 為 11.0 K，345 GHz 為 16.6 K，650 GHz 為 31.2 K，870 GHz 為 41.8 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Quantum noise limit hν/k: 11.0 K at 230 GHz, 16.6 K at 345 GHz, 31.2 K at 650 GHz and 41.8 K at 870 GHz.","failure":"常見誤解：「混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「SIS 混頻器與本振」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “SIS mixer and local oscillator”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-13-k1","title":"SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台","titleEn":"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage","text":"在 ALMA 的毫米／次毫米波段（84–950 GHz），HEMT 放大器的雜訊已不夠低，所以前端改用 4 K 的 Nb/AlOx/Nb 超導–絕緣–超導（SIS）穿隧接面當混頻器：本振光子協助電子穿隧，把天體訊號降頻到 4–12 GHz 的中頻，再交給低溫 HEMT 放大。SIS 混頻器的雜訊可以接近量子極限 hν/k，而 Nb 的能隙限制了可用頻率，更高頻段改用 NbTiN 電極；混頻器、本振耦合與中頻放大器都裝在同一個卡匣裡。","textEn":"In the ALMA millimetre and submillimetre bands (84–950 GHz) HEMT amplifiers are no longer quiet enough, so the front end uses 4 K Nb/AlOx/Nb superconductor–insulator–superconductor (SIS) tunnel junctions as mixers: local-oscillator photons assist electron tunnelling and the sky signal is down-converted to a 4–12 GHz IF that is then amplified by cryogenic HEMTs. SIS mixer noise can approach the quantum limit hν/k, and the niobium gap limits the usable frequency, so higher bands use NbTiN electrodes; mixer, LO coupling and IF amplifier sit together in one cartridge.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage\" is correct?","options":["混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。","在 ALMA 的毫米／次毫米波段（84–950 GHz），HEMT 放大器的雜訊已不夠低，所以前端改用 4 K 的 Nb/AlOx/Nb 超導–絕緣–超導（SIS）穿隧接面當混頻器：本振光子協助電子穿隧，把天體訊號降頻到 4–12 GHz 的中頻，再交給低溫 HEMT 放大。","雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。"],"optionsEn":["Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.","In the ALMA millimetre and submillimetre bands (84–950 GHz) HEMT amplifiers are no longer quiet enough, so the front end uses 4 K Nb/AlOx/Nb superconductor–insulator–superconductor (SIS) tunnel junctions as mixers: local-oscillator photons assist electron tunnelling and the sky signal is down-converted to a 4–12 GHz IF that is then amplified by cryogenic HEMTs.","Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在 ALMA 的毫米／次毫米波段（84–950 GHz），HEMT 放大器的雜訊已不夠低，所以前端改用 4 K 的 Nb/AlOx/Nb 超導–絕緣–超導（SIS）穿隧接面當混頻器：本振光子協助電子穿隧，把天體訊號降頻到 4–12 GHz 的中頻，再交給低溫 HEMT 放大。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In the ALMA millimetre and submillimetre bands (84–950 GHz) HEMT amplifiers are no longer quiet enough, so the front end uses 4 K Nb/AlOx/Nb superconductor–insulator–superconductor (SIS) tunnel junctions as mixers: local-oscillator photons assist electron tunnelling and the sky signal is down-converted to a 4–12 GHz IF that is then amplified by cryogenic HEMTs. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a474-v12-14","title":"SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台：定量估算","titleEn":"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「SIS 混頻器與本振」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “SIS mixer and local oscillator” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：量子雜訊極限 hν/k：230 GHz 為 11.0 K，345 GHz 為 16.6 K，650 GHz 為 31.2 K，870 GHz 為 41.8 K。一台 230 GHz 接收機若 T_rx = 40 K，即約 3.6 倍量子極限。Nb 能隙電壓約 2.8 mV，對應能隙頻率 2Δ/h ≈ 680 GHz；230 GHz 的光子台階寬度 hν/e = 0.95 mV。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Quantum noise limit hν/k: 11.0 K at 230 GHz, 16.6 K at 345 GHz, 31.2 K at 650 GHz and 41.8 K at 870 GHz. A 230 GHz receiver with T_rx = 40 K sits at about 3.6 times the quantum limit. The niobium gap voltage of about 2.8 mV corresponds to a gap frequency 2Δ/h ≈ 680 GHz, and the photon step at 230 GHz is hν/e = 0.95 mV wide. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量測有本振與無本振的 I–V 曲線，確認能隙以下出現寬度 hν/e 的光子台階；在真空窗前放 300 K 與 77 K 負載做 Y 因子，掃描本振功率找出中頻輸出功率對雜訊最佳的泵浦點；核對磁場線圈是否壓制了 Josephson 電流。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record pumped and unpumped I–V curves and confirm photon steps of width hν/e below the gap; place 300 K and 77 K loads in front of the vacuum window for a Y-factor measurement while sweeping LO power to find the pumping point that optimises IF output versus noise; check that the magnet coil suppresses the Josephson current.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"量子雜訊極限 hν/k：230 GHz 為 11.0 K，345 GHz 為 16.6 K，650 GHz 為 31.2 K，870 GHz 為 41.8 K。一台 230 GHz 接收機若 T_rx = 40 K，即約 3.6 倍量子極限。Nb 能隙電壓約 2.8 mV，對應能隙頻率 2Δ/h ≈ 680 GHz；230 GHz 的光子台階寬度 hν/e = 0.95 mV。","textEn":"Quantum noise limit hν/k: 11.0 K at 230 GHz, 16.6 K at 345 GHz, 31.2 K at 650 GHz and 41.8 K at 870 GHz. A 230 GHz receiver with T_rx = 40 K sits at about 3.6 times the quantum limit. The niobium gap voltage of about 2.8 mV corresponds to a gap frequency 2Δ/h ≈ 680 GHz, and the photon step at 230 GHz is hν/e = 0.95 mV wide.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage\", which statement holds?","options":["真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。","雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","量子雜訊極限 hν/k：230 GHz 為 11.0 K，345 GHz 為 16.6 K，650 GHz 為 31.2 K，870 GHz 為 41.8 K。"],"optionsEn":["A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat.","Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","Quantum noise limit hν/k: 11.0 K at 230 GHz, 16.6 K at 345 GHz, 31.2 K at 650 GHz and 41.8 K at 870 GHz."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量子雜訊極限 hν/k：230 GHz 為 11.0 K，345 GHz 為 16.6 K，650 GHz 為 31.2 K，870 GHz 為 41.8 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Quantum noise limit hν/k: 11.0 K at 230 GHz, 16.6 K at 345 GHz, 31.2 K at 650 GHz and 41.8 K at 870 GHz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a474-v12-15","title":"SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台：量測與驗證","titleEn":"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「SIS 混頻器與本振」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “SIS mixer and local oscillator” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量測有本振與無本振的 I–V 曲線，確認能隙以下出現寬度 hν/e 的光子台階；在真空窗前放 300 K 與 77 K 負載做 Y 因子，掃描本振功率找出中頻輸出功率對雜訊最佳的泵浦點；核對磁場線圈是否壓制了 Josephson 電流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record pumped and unpumped I–V curves and confirm photon steps of width hν/e below the gap; place 300 K and 77 K loads in front of the vacuum window for a Y-factor measurement while sweeping LO power to find the pumping point that optimises IF output versus noise; check that the magnet coil suppresses the Josephson current. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：本振功率過高或磁場未調好時，Josephson 雜訊使增益跳動、雜訊暴增；4 K 平台熱接觸退化讓接面溫度升到 5 K，能隙縮小、漏電流增加，接收機雜訊隨溫度一路爬升。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Too much LO power or a mis-set magnetic field lets Josephson noise make the gain jump and the noise explode; a degraded thermal contact on the 4 K stage raises the junction to 5 K, the gap shrinks, leakage current rises and the receiver noise climbs with temperature.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測有本振與無本振的 I–V 曲線，確認能隙以下出現寬度 hν/e 的光子台階；在真空窗前放 300 K 與 77 K 負載做 Y 因子，掃描本振功率找出中頻輸出功率對雜訊最佳的泵浦點；核對磁場線圈是否壓制了 Josephson 電流。","textEn":"Record pumped and unpumped I–V curves and confirm photon steps of width hν/e below the gap; place 300 K and 77 K loads in front of the vacuum window for a Y-factor measurement while sweeping LO power to find the pumping point that optimises IF output versus noise; check that the magnet coil suppresses the Josephson current.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage\"?","options":["量測有本振與無本振的 I–V 曲線，確認能隙以下出現寬度 hν/e 的光子台階。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Record pumped and unpumped I–V curves and confirm photon steps of width hν/e below the gap.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"量測有本振與無本振的 I–V 曲線，確認能隙以下出現寬度 hν/e 的光子台階；在真空窗前放 300 K 與 77 K 負載做 Y 因子，掃描本振功率找出中頻輸出功率對雜訊最佳的泵浦點；核對磁場線圈是否壓制了 Josephson 電流。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record pumped and unpumped I–V curves and confirm photon steps of width hν/e below the gap; place 300 K and 77 K loads in front of the vacuum window for a Y-factor measurement while sweeping LO power to find the pumping point that optimises IF output versus noise; check that the magnet coil suppresses the Josephson current. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a474-v12-16","title":"SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台：失效診斷","titleEn":"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「SIS 混頻器與本振」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “SIS mixer and local oscillator” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"本振功率過高或磁場未調好時，Josephson 雜訊使增益跳動、雜訊暴增；4 K 平台熱接觸退化讓接面溫度升到 5 K，能隙縮小、漏電流增加，接收機雜訊隨溫度一路爬升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Too much LO power or a mis-set magnetic field lets Josephson noise make the gain jump and the noise explode; a degraded thermal contact on the 4 K stage raises the junction to 5 K, the gap shrinks, leakage current rises and the receiver noise climbs with temperature. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：SIS 混頻器的雜訊可以接近量子極限 hν/k，而 Nb 的能隙限制了可用頻率，更高頻段改用 NbTiN 電極；混頻器、本振耦合與中頻放大器都裝在同一個卡匣裡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: SIS mixer noise can approach the quantum limit hν/k, and the niobium gap limits the usable frequency, so higher bands use NbTiN electrodes; mixer, LO coupling and IF amplifier sit together in one cartridge.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"本振功率過高或磁場未調好時，Josephson 雜訊使增益跳動、雜訊暴增；4 K 平台熱接觸退化讓接面溫度升到 5 K，能隙縮小、漏電流增加，接收機雜訊隨溫度一路爬升。","textEn":"Too much LO power or a mis-set magnetic field lets Josephson noise make the gain jump and the noise explode; a degraded thermal contact on the 4 K stage raises the junction to 5 K, the gap shrinks, leakage current rises and the receiver noise climbs with temperature.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「SIS 混頻、量子雜訊極限與 4 K 平台」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"SIS mixing, quantum noise limit and the 4 K stage\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","本振功率過高或磁場未調好時，Josephson 雜訊使增益跳動、雜訊暴增。","雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Too much LO power or a mis-set magnetic field lets Josephson noise make the gain jump and the noise explode.","Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever."],"answer":1,"explanation":"本振功率過高或磁場未調好時，Josephson 雜訊使增益跳動、雜訊暴增；4 K 平台熱接觸退化讓接面溫度升到 5 K，能隙縮小、漏電流增加，接收機雜訊隨溫度一路爬升。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Too much LO power or a mis-set magnetic field lets Josephson noise make the gain jump and the noise explode; a degraded thermal contact on the 4 K stage raises the junction to 5 K, the gap shrinks, leakage current rises and the receiver noise climbs with temperature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a474-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正」與「增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration\" and \"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a474-v12-17","title":"Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hot/cold loads and noise diode” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"接收機雜訊以 Y 因子法量測：對溫度 T_hot 與 T_cold 的兩個黑體負載記錄輸出功率比 Y = P_hot/P_cold，解得 T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)。日常觀測不方便搬負載，改用耦合進前端的雜訊二極體：它注入已知的 T_cal，由開／關功率比得到 Tsys = T_cal/(P_on/P_off − 1)，而 T_cal 本身必須定期用負載回溯校正。毫米波系統（如 ALMA 的校正裝置）用常溫與加熱負載，再配合天空傾角掃描求大氣不透明度。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Receiver noise is measured by the Y-factor method: record the output-power ratio Y = P_hot/P_cold for two blackbody loads at T_hot and T_cold and solve T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1). Since loads are impractical during routine observing, a noise diode coupled into the front end injects a known T_cal, and the on/off power ratio gives Tsys = T_cal/(P_on/P_off − 1), with T_cal itself traced back to the loads periodically. Millimetre systems such as the ALMA calibration device use ambient and heated loads together with sky dips to obtain the atmospheric opacity. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Hot/cold loads and noise diode”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：T_hot = 295 K、T_cold = 77 K、量到 Y = 3.2：T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With T_hot = 295 K, T_cold = 77 K and a measured Y = 3.2, T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K.","failure":"常見誤解：「雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Hot/cold loads and noise diode”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-17-k1","title":"Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正","titleEn":"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration","text":"接收機雜訊以 Y 因子法量測：對溫度 T_hot 與 T_cold 的兩個黑體負載記錄輸出功率比 Y = P_hot/P_cold，解得 T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)。日常觀測不方便搬負載，改用耦合進前端的雜訊二極體：它注入已知的 T_cal，由開／關功率比得到 Tsys = T_cal/(P_on/P_off − 1)，而 T_cal 本身必須定期用負載回溯校正。","textEn":"Receiver noise is measured by the Y-factor method: record the output-power ratio Y = P_hot/P_cold for two blackbody loads at T_hot and T_cold and solve T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1). Since loads are impractical during routine observing, a noise diode coupled into the front end injects a known T_cal, and the on/off power ratio gives Tsys = T_cal/(P_on/P_off − 1), with T_cal itself traced back to the loads periodically.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration\" is correct?","options":["雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。","積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。","接收機雜訊以 Y 因子法量測：對溫度 T_hot 與 T_cold 的兩個黑體負載記錄輸出功率比 Y = P_hot/P_cold，解得 T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)。"],"optionsEn":["Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever.","Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.","Receiver noise is measured by the Y-factor method: record the output-power ratio Y = P_hot/P_cold for two blackbody loads at T_hot and T_cold and solve T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"接收機雜訊以 Y 因子法量測：對溫度 T_hot 與 T_cold 的兩個黑體負載記錄輸出功率比 Y = P_hot/P_cold，解得 T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Receiver noise is measured by the Y-factor method: record the output-power ratio Y = P_hot/P_cold for two blackbody loads at T_hot and T_cold and solve T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1). The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a474-v12-18","title":"Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hot/cold loads and noise diode” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：T_hot = 295 K、T_cold = 77 K、量到 Y = 3.2：T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K。若冷負載因結霜實際為 80 K，同一個 Y 解出 T_rx = 17.7 K，誤差達 4 K。雜訊二極體 T_cal = 2 K、P_on/P_off = 1.08 時 Tsys = 2/0.08 = 25 K，與 T_rx 22 K 加上約 3 K 天空貢獻一致。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With T_hot = 295 K, T_cold = 77 K and a measured Y = 3.2, T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K. If frost makes the cold load effectively 80 K, the same Y yields T_rx = 17.7 K, a 4 K error. A noise diode with T_cal = 2 K and P_on/P_off = 1.08 gives Tsys = 2/0.08 = 25 K, consistent with T_rx = 22 K plus about 3 K of sky. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在真空窗前以負載做 Y 因子，每月用同一程序回溯校正雜訊二極體的 T_cal；觀測時記錄 Tsys 對仰角的曲線（天空傾角），用 T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) 擬合不透明度，確認扣除大氣後的 T_rx 與實驗室值一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Do a Y-factor at the vacuum window with loads and re-trace the noise-diode T_cal against them monthly with the same procedure; during observing log Tsys versus elevation (sky dip), fit the opacity with T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) and confirm that T_rx after removing the atmosphere matches the laboratory value.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"T_hot = 295 K、T_cold = 77 K、量到 Y = 3.2：T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K。若冷負載因結霜實際為 80 K，同一個 Y 解出 T_rx = 17.7 K，誤差達 4 K。雜訊二極體 T_cal = 2 K、P_on/P_off = 1.08 時 Tsys = 2/0.08 = 25 K，與 T_rx 22 K 加上約 3 K 天空貢獻一致。","textEn":"With T_hot = 295 K, T_cold = 77 K and a measured Y = 3.2, T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K. If frost makes the cold load effectively 80 K, the same Y yields T_rx = 17.7 K, a 4 K error. A noise diode with T_cal = 2 K and P_on/P_off = 1.08 gives Tsys = 2/0.08 = 25 K, consistent with T_rx = 22 K plus about 3 K of sky.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration\", which statement holds?","options":["T_hot = 295 K、T_cold = 77 K、量到 Y = 3.2：T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K。","通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。","把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["With T_hot = 295 K, T_cold = 77 K and a measured Y = 3.2, T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K.","Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope.","The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"T_hot = 295 K、T_cold = 77 K、量到 Y = 3.2：T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With T_hot = 295 K, T_cold = 77 K and a measured Y = 3.2, T_rx = (295 − 3.2×77)/2.2 = 22.1 K. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a474-v12-19","title":"Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Hot/cold loads and noise diode” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在真空窗前以負載做 Y 因子，每月用同一程序回溯校正雜訊二極體的 T_cal；觀測時記錄 Tsys 對仰角的曲線（天空傾角），用 T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) 擬合不透明度，確認扣除大氣後的 T_rx 與實驗室值一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Do a Y-factor at the vacuum window with loads and re-trace the noise-diode T_cal against them monthly with the same procedure; during observing log Tsys versus elevation (sky dip), fit the opacity with T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) and confirm that T_rx after removing the atmosphere matches the laboratory value. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：雜訊二極體的輸出隨其物理溫度與老化漂移，若未回溯校正，每 5% 的 T_cal 誤差就直接變成 5% 的流量尺度誤差，而且會悄悄進入所有觀測資料。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: The noise-diode output drifts with its physical temperature and ageing; without re-tracing, every 5% error in T_cal becomes a 5% flux-scale error that silently enters every observation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在真空窗前以負載做 Y 因子，每月用同一程序回溯校正雜訊二極體的 T_cal；觀測時記錄 Tsys 對仰角的曲線（天空傾角），用 T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) 擬合不透明度，確認扣除大氣後的 T_rx 與實驗室值一致。","textEn":"Do a Y-factor at the vacuum window with loads and re-trace the noise-diode T_cal against them monthly with the same procedure; during observing log Tsys versus elevation (sky dip), fit the opacity with T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) and confirm that T_rx after removing the atmosphere matches the laboratory value.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","在真空窗前以負載做 Y 因子，每月用同一程序回溯校正雜訊二極體的 T_cal。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Do a Y-factor at the vacuum window with loads and re-trace the noise-diode T_cal against them monthly with the same procedure.","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在真空窗前以負載做 Y 因子，每月用同一程序回溯校正雜訊二極體的 T_cal；觀測時記錄 Tsys 對仰角的曲線（天空傾角），用 T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) 擬合不透明度，確認扣除大氣後的 T_rx 與實驗室值一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Do a Y-factor at the vacuum window with loads and re-trace the noise-diode T_cal against them monthly with the same procedure; during observing log Tsys versus elevation (sky dip), fit the opacity with T_sky = T_atm(1 − e^(−τ/sinEl)) and confirm that T_rx after removing the atmosphere matches the laboratory value. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a474-v12-20","title":"Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「熱／冷負載與雜訊二極體」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Hot/cold loads and noise diode” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"雜訊二極體的輸出隨其物理溫度與老化漂移，若未回溯校正，每 5% 的 T_cal 誤差就直接變成 5% 的流量尺度誤差，而且會悄悄進入所有觀測資料。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"The noise-diode output drifts with its physical temperature and ageing; without re-tracing, every 5% error in T_cal becomes a 5% flux-scale error that silently enters every observation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：毫米波系統（如 ALMA 的校正裝置）用常溫與加熱負載，再配合天空傾角掃描求大氣不透明度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Millimetre systems such as the ALMA calibration device use ambient and heated loads together with sky dips to obtain the atmospheric opacity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"雜訊二極體的輸出隨其物理溫度與老化漂移，若未回溯校正，每 5% 的 T_cal 誤差就直接變成 5% 的流量尺度誤差，而且會悄悄進入所有觀測資料。","textEn":"The noise-diode output drifts with its physical temperature and ageing; without re-tracing, every 5% error in T_cal becomes a 5% flux-scale error that silently enters every observation.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Y 因子、雜訊二極體與 Tsys 校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Y-factor, noise diode and Tsys calibration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。","雜訊二極體的輸出隨其物理溫度與老化漂移，若未回溯校正，每 5% 的 T_cal 誤差就直接變成 5% 的流量尺度誤差，而且會悄悄進入所有觀測資料。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.","The noise-diode output drifts with its physical temperature and ageing."],"answer":2,"explanation":"雜訊二極體的輸出隨其物理溫度與老化漂移，若未回溯校正，每 5% 的 T_cal 誤差就直接變成 5% 的流量尺度誤差，而且會悄悄進入所有觀測資料。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"The noise-diode output drifts with its physical temperature and ageing; without re-tracing, every 5% error in T_cal becomes a 5% flux-scale error that silently enters every observation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a474-v12-21","title":"增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gain stability and Allan variance” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"輻射計雜訊隨 1/√τ 下降，但放大器的 1/f 增益漲落與大氣發射的起伏會隨 τ 增加而上升，兩者相加在 Allan 變異數圖上形成一個最小值，對應的 τ_A 就是單次積分的上限。超過 τ_A 再積分只會更差，因此總功率觀測必須以快於 τ_A 的節奏做位置、波束或頻率切換；對 ALMA 這種寬頻系統，增益穩定度的規格比雜訊溫度更難達成。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Radiometer noise falls as 1/√τ, but 1/f gain fluctuations of the amplifiers and fluctuations of atmospheric emission rise with τ; their sum produces a minimum in the Allan-variance plot, and the corresponding τ_A is the ceiling on a single integration. Integrating beyond τ_A only makes things worse, so total-power observing must switch position, beam or frequency faster than τ_A; for a wideband system such as ALMA the gain-stability specification is harder to meet than the noise temperature. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Gain stability and Allan variance”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²].","failure":"常見誤解：「積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Gain stability and Allan variance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-21-k1","title":"增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間","titleEn":"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time","text":"輻射計雜訊隨 1/√τ 下降，但放大器的 1/f 增益漲落與大氣發射的起伏會隨 τ 增加而上升，兩者相加在 Allan 變異數圖上形成一個最小值，對應的 τ_A 就是單次積分的上限。超過 τ_A 再積分只會更差，因此總功率觀測必須以快於 τ_A 的節奏做位置、波束或頻率切換；對 ALMA 這種寬頻系統，增益穩定度的規格比雜訊溫度更難達成。","textEn":"Radiometer noise falls as 1/√τ, but 1/f gain fluctuations of the amplifiers and fluctuations of atmospheric emission rise with τ; their sum produces a minimum in the Allan-variance plot, and the corresponding τ_A is the ceiling on a single integration. Integrating beyond τ_A only makes things worse, so total-power observing must switch position, beam or frequency faster than τ_A; for a wideband system such as ALMA the gain-stability specification is harder to meet than the noise temperature.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Longer integration always gives better sensitivity. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time\" is correct?","options":["輻射計雜訊隨 1/√τ 下降，但放大器的 1/f 增益漲落與大氣發射的起伏會隨 τ 增加而上升，兩者相加在 Allan 變異數圖上形成一個最小值，對應的 τ_A 就是單次積分的上限。","積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。","真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。"],"optionsEn":["Radiometer noise falls as 1/√τ, but 1/f gain fluctuations of the amplifiers and fluctuations of atmospheric emission rise with τ.","Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.","A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"輻射計雜訊隨 1/√τ 下降，但放大器的 1/f 增益漲落與大氣發射的起伏會隨 τ 增加而上升，兩者相加在 Allan 變異數圖上形成一個最小值，對應的 τ_A 就是單次積分的上限。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Radiometer noise falls as 1/√τ, but 1/f gain fluctuations of the amplifiers and fluctuations of atmospheric emission rise with τ; their sum produces a minimum in the Allan-variance plot, and the corresponding τ_A is the ceiling on a single integration. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a474-v12-22","title":"增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gain stability and Allan variance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]。B = 2 GHz、Tsys = 50 K 時，τ = 1 s 的輻射計項為 50/√2e9 = 1.1 mK；若 ΔG/G = 1e−4，增益項已達 5 mK。兩項相等的時間 τ_A = 1/[B(ΔG/G)²] = 1/(2e9×1e−8) = 0.05 s，所以切換必須快於 20 Hz，或把增益穩定到 1e−5 使 τ_A 延長到 5 s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]. With B = 2 GHz and Tsys = 50 K the radiometer term at τ = 1 s is 50/√2e9 = 1.1 mK; with ΔG/G = 1e−4 the gain term is already 5 mK. The two are equal at τ_A = 1/[B(ΔG/G)²] = 1/(2e9×1e−8) = 0.05 s, so switching must run faster than 20 Hz, or the gain must be stabilised to 1e−5 to stretch τ_A to 5 s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：對穩定負載記錄至少 1 小時的總功率時間序列，計算 Allan 偏差對 τ 的曲線：白雜訊段斜率 −1/2、平坦段為 1/f、上升段為漂移；讀出 τ_A 並與預定的切換週期比較，切換週期必須明顯短於 τ_A。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record at least one hour of total-power time series on a stable load and compute the Allan deviation versus τ: the white-noise segment has slope −1/2, the flat segment is 1/f and the rising segment is drift; read off τ_A and compare with the planned switching cycle, which must be clearly shorter than τ_A.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]。B = 2 GHz、Tsys = 50 K 時，τ = 1 s 的輻射計項為 50/√2e9 = 1.1 mK；若 ΔG/G = 1e−4，增益項已達 5 mK。兩項相等的時間 τ_A = 1/[B(ΔG/G)²] = 1/(2e9×1e−8) = 0.05 s，所以切換必須快於 20 Hz，或把增益穩定到 1e−5 使 τ_A 延長到 5 s。","textEn":"ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]. With B = 2 GHz and Tsys = 50 K the radiometer term at τ = 1 s is 50/√2e9 = 1.1 mK; with ΔG/G = 1e−4 the gain term is already 5 mK. The two are equal at τ_A = 1/[B(ΔG/G)²] = 1/(2e9×1e−8) = 0.05 s, so switching must run faster than 20 Hz, or the gain must be stabilised to 1e−5 to stretch τ_A to 5 s.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time\", which statement holds?","options":["雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。"],"optionsEn":["Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²].","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature."],"answer":1,"explanation":"ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"ΔT² = Tsys²[1/(Bτ) + (ΔG/G)²]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a474-v12-23","title":"增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Gain stability and Allan variance” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"對穩定負載記錄至少 1 小時的總功率時間序列，計算 Allan 偏差對 τ 的曲線：白雜訊段斜率 −1/2、平坦段為 1/f、上升段為漂移；讀出 τ_A 並與預定的切換週期比較，切換週期必須明顯短於 τ_A。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record at least one hour of total-power time series on a stable load and compute the Allan deviation versus τ: the white-noise segment has slope −1/2, the flat segment is 1/f and the rising segment is drift; read off τ_A and compare with the planned switching cycle, which must be clearly shorter than τ_A. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：GM 低溫機 1 Hz 的活塞週期讓 LNA 溫度微幅起伏，增益隨之調變，Allan 圖在 1 s 附近出現凸起、頻譜上出現 1 Hz 諧波；電源漣波也會以同樣方式進入資料。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: The 1 Hz piston cycle of a GM cryocooler modulates the LNA temperature slightly and hence its gain, producing a bump near 1 s in the Allan plot and 1 Hz harmonics in the spectrum; power-supply ripple enters the data the same way.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對穩定負載記錄至少 1 小時的總功率時間序列，計算 Allan 偏差對 τ 的曲線：白雜訊段斜率 −1/2、平坦段為 1/f、上升段為漂移；讀出 τ_A 並與預定的切換週期比較，切換週期必須明顯短於 τ_A。","textEn":"Record at least one hour of total-power time series on a stable load and compute the Allan deviation versus τ: the white-noise segment has slope −1/2, the flat segment is 1/f and the rising segment is drift; read off τ_A and compare with the planned switching cycle, which must be clearly shorter than τ_A.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。","對穩定負載記錄至少 1 小時的總功率時間序列，計算 Allan 偏差對 τ 的曲線：白雜訊段斜率 −1/2、平坦段為 1/f、上升段為漂移。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.","Record at least one hour of total-power time series on a stable load and compute the Allan deviation versus τ: the white-noise segment has slope −1/2, the flat segment is 1/f and the rising segment is drift."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對穩定負載記錄至少 1 小時的總功率時間序列，計算 Allan 偏差對 τ 的曲線：白雜訊段斜率 −1/2、平坦段為 1/f、上升段為漂移；讀出 τ_A 並與預定的切換週期比較，切換週期必須明顯短於 τ_A。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record at least one hour of total-power time series on a stable load and compute the Allan deviation versus τ: the white-noise segment has slope −1/2, the flat segment is 1/f and the rising segment is drift; read off τ_A and compare with the planned switching cycle, which must be clearly shorter than τ_A. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a474-v12-24","title":"增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「增益穩定度與 Allan 變異數」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Gain stability and Allan variance” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"GM 低溫機 1 Hz 的活塞週期讓 LNA 溫度微幅起伏，增益隨之調變，Allan 圖在 1 s 附近出現凸起、頻譜上出現 1 Hz 諧波；電源漣波也會以同樣方式進入資料。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"The 1 Hz piston cycle of a GM cryocooler modulates the LNA temperature slightly and hence its gain, producing a bump near 1 s in the Allan plot and 1 Hz harmonics in the spectrum; power-supply ripple enters the data the same way. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：超過 τ_A 再積分只會更差，因此總功率觀測必須以快於 τ_A 的節奏做位置、波束或頻率切換；對 ALMA 這種寬頻系統，增益穩定度的規格比雜訊溫度更難達成。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Integrating beyond τ_A only makes things worse, so total-power observing must switch position, beam or frequency faster than τ_A; for a wideband system such as ALMA the gain-stability specification is harder to meet than the noise temperature.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Longer integration always gives better sensitivity.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"GM 低溫機 1 Hz 的活塞週期讓 LNA 溫度微幅起伏，增益隨之調變，Allan 圖在 1 s 附近出現凸起、頻譜上出現 1 Hz 諧波；電源漣波也會以同樣方式進入資料。","textEn":"The 1 Hz piston cycle of a GM cryocooler modulates the LNA temperature slightly and hence its gain, producing a bump near 1 s in the Allan plot and 1 Hz harmonics in the spectrum; power-supply ripple enters the data the same way.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「增益漲落、1/f 雜訊與 Allan 時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gain fluctuations, 1/f noise and the Allan time\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["GM 低溫機 1 Hz 的活塞週期讓 LNA 溫度微幅起伏，增益隨之調變，Allan 圖在 1 s 附近出現凸起、頻譜上出現 1 Hz 諧波。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。"],"optionsEn":["The 1 Hz piston cycle of a GM cryocooler modulates the LNA temperature slightly and hence its gain, producing a bump near 1 s in the Allan plot and 1 Hz harmonics in the spectrum.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"GM 低溫機 1 Hz 的活塞週期讓 LNA 溫度微幅起伏，增益隨之調變，Allan 圖在 1 s 附近出現凸起、頻譜上出現 1 Hz 諧波；電源漣波也會以同樣方式進入資料。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"The 1 Hz piston cycle of a GM cryocooler modulates the LNA temperature slightly and hence its gain, producing a bump near 1 s in the Allan plot and 1 Hz harmonics in the spectrum; power-supply ripple enters the data the same way. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a474-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波」與「驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves\" and \"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a474-v12-25","title":"低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"ALMA 的前端把多個波段卡匣裝進同一個低溫恆溫器，三級 GM 低溫機提供約 110 K、15 K 與 4 K 的平台；熱負載來自輻射、波導與同軸線的傳導，以及放大器本身的耗散，每一級的預算都要算清楚。真空窗與紅外濾片必須在該波段低損耗，但窗與饋源之間任何殘餘反射都會形成駐波，使頻帶響應出現週期性漣波，週期為 c/(2L)，L 是兩反射面的間距。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The ALMA front end packs several band cartridges into one cryostat whose three-stage GM cryocooler provides stages near 110 K, 15 K and 4 K; heat loads come from radiation, conduction through waveguides and coaxial lines, and the dissipation of the amplifiers themselves, and every stage needs its own budget. The vacuum window and infrared filter must be low-loss in band, yet any residual reflection between the window and the feed forms a standing wave that imprints periodic ripple on the bandpass with period c/(2L), L being the spacing of the two reflecting surfaces. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：輻射負載 Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold)：300 K 外殼對 110 K 屏蔽、有效發射率 0.05、面積 1 m² 時 Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W，這決定了第一級的需求。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Radiative load Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold): a 300 K shell facing a 110 K shield with effective emissivity 0.05 over 1 m² gives Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W, which sizes the first stage.","failure":"常見誤解：「真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-25-k1","title":"低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波","titleEn":"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves","text":"ALMA 的前端把多個波段卡匣裝進同一個低溫恆溫器，三級 GM 低溫機提供約 110 K、15 K 與 4 K 的平台；熱負載來自輻射、波導與同軸線的傳導，以及放大器本身的耗散，每一級的預算都要算清楚。真空窗與紅外濾片必須在該波段低損耗，但窗與饋源之間任何殘餘反射都會形成駐波，使頻帶響應出現週期性漣波，週期為 c/(2L)，L 是兩反射面的間距。","textEn":"The ALMA front end packs several band cartridges into one cryostat whose three-stage GM cryocooler provides stages near 110 K, 15 K and 4 K; heat loads come from radiation, conduction through waveguides and coaxial lines, and the dissipation of the amplifiers themselves, and every stage needs its own budget. The vacuum window and infrared filter must be low-loss in band, yet any residual reflection between the window and the feed forms a standing wave that imprints periodic ripple on the bandpass with period c/(2L), L being the spacing of the two reflecting surfaces.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves\" is correct?","options":["真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。","ALMA 的前端把多個波段卡匣裝進同一個低溫恆溫器，三級 GM 低溫機提供約 110 K、15 K 與 4 K 的平台。","通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat.","The ALMA front end packs several band cartridges into one cryostat whose three-stage GM cryocooler provides stages near 110 K, 15 K and 4 K.","Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope."],"answer":1,"explanation":"ALMA 的前端把多個波段卡匣裝進同一個低溫恆溫器，三級 GM 低溫機提供約 110 K、15 K 與 4 K 的平台；熱負載來自輻射、波導與同軸線的傳導，以及放大器本身的耗散，每一級的預算都要算清楚。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The ALMA front end packs several band cartridges into one cryostat whose three-stage GM cryocooler provides stages near 110 K, 15 K and 4 K; heat loads come from radiation, conduction through waveguides and coaxial lines, and the dissipation of the amplifiers themselves, and every stage needs its own budget. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a474-v12-26","title":"低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波：定量估算","titleEn":"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：輻射負載 Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold)：300 K 外殼對 110 K 屏蔽、有效發射率 0.05、面積 1 m² 時 Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W，這決定了第一級的需求。窗與饋源相距 L = 0.3 m 時，駐波漣波週期 Δν = c/(2L) = 3e8/0.6 = 500 MHz。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Radiative load Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold): a 300 K shell facing a 110 K shield with effective emissivity 0.05 over 1 m² gives Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W, which sizes the first stage. With the window 0.3 m from the feed, the standing-wave ripple period is Δν = c/(2L) = 3e8/0.6 = 500 MHz. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：記錄降溫曲線與各級穩態溫度，和熱負載模型比較；用平坦負載量頻帶響應，對漣波做傅立葉分析得到週期 Δν，反推 L = c/(2Δν) 找出是哪一對反射面；檢查真空度是否維持在 1e−6 mbar 以下、長時間是否上升。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log the cooldown curve and the steady-state stage temperatures and compare with the heat-load model; measure the bandpass on a flat load, Fourier-analyse the ripple to get its period Δν and locate the reflecting pair from L = c/(2Δν); check that the vacuum stays below 1e−6 mbar and does not rise over time.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"輻射負載 Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold)：300 K 外殼對 110 K 屏蔽、有效發射率 0.05、面積 1 m² 時 Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W，這決定了第一級的需求。窗與饋源相距 L = 0.3 m 時，駐波漣波週期 Δν = c/(2L) = 3e8/0.6 = 500 MHz。","textEn":"Radiative load Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold): a 300 K shell facing a 110 K shield with effective emissivity 0.05 over 1 m² gives Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W, which sizes the first stage. With the window 0.3 m from the feed, the standing-wave ripple period is Δν = c/(2L) = 3e8/0.6 = 500 MHz.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves\", which statement holds?","options":["把副鏡照明得越均勻，整體孔徑效率一定越高。","混頻器把訊號降到較低頻率，雜訊也會按比例降低。","輻射負載 Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold)：300 K 外殼對 110 K 屏蔽、有效發射率 0.05、面積 1 m² 時 Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W，這決定了第一級的需求。"],"optionsEn":["The more uniformly the subreflector is illuminated, the higher the overall aperture efficiency.","Down-converting the signal to a lower frequency reduces the noise in proportion.","Radiative load Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold): a 300 K shell facing a 110 K shield with effective emissivity 0.05 over 1 m² gives Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W, which sizes the first stage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"輻射負載 Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold)：300 K 外殼對 110 K 屏蔽、有效發射率 0.05、面積 1 m² 時 Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W，這決定了第一級的需求。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Radiative load Q = εσA(T⁴_hot − T⁴_cold): a 300 K shell facing a 110 K shield with effective emissivity 0.05 over 1 m² gives Q = 0.05×5.67e−8×(300⁴ − 110⁴) ≈ 22 W, which sizes the first stage. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a474-v12-27","title":"低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"記錄降溫曲線與各級穩態溫度，和熱負載模型比較；用平坦負載量頻帶響應，對漣波做傅立葉分析得到週期 Δν，反推 L = c/(2Δν) 找出是哪一對反射面；檢查真空度是否維持在 1e−6 mbar 以下、長時間是否上升。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log the cooldown curve and the steady-state stage temperatures and compare with the heat-load model; measure the bandpass on a flat load, Fourier-analyse the ripple to get its period Δν and locate the reflecting pair from L = c/(2Δν); check that the vacuum stays below 1e−6 mbar and does not rise over time. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：真空微漏讓空氣在 4 K 表面低溫泵吸，先是平台溫度緩升，接著水氣在真空窗內結霜造成損耗，雜訊溫度在幾週內逐步惡化；低溫機氦氣污染則讓 4 K 級漂到 5 K 以上，SIS 性能同時衰退。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A small vacuum leak lets air cryopump onto the 4 K surfaces, the stage temperature creeps up, then water frosts the inside of the window and adds loss, and the noise temperature degrades over weeks; helium contamination of the cryocooler drifts the 4 K stage above 5 K and the SIS performance falls with it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄降溫曲線與各級穩態溫度，和熱負載模型比較；用平坦負載量頻帶響應，對漣波做傅立葉分析得到週期 Δν，反推 L = c/(2Δν) 找出是哪一對反射面；檢查真空度是否維持在 1e−6 mbar 以下、長時間是否上升。","textEn":"Log the cooldown curve and the steady-state stage temperatures and compare with the heat-load model; measure the bandpass on a flat load, Fourier-analyse the ripple to get its period Δν and locate the reflecting pair from L = c/(2Δν); check that the vacuum stays below 1e−6 mbar and does not rise over time.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves\"?","options":["記錄降溫曲線與各級穩態溫度，和熱負載模型比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。"],"optionsEn":["Log the cooldown curve and the steady-state stage temperatures and compare with the heat-load model.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever."],"answer":0,"explanation":"記錄降溫曲線與各級穩態溫度，和熱負載模型比較；用平坦負載量頻帶響應，對漣波做傅立葉分析得到週期 Δν，反推 L = c/(2Δν) 找出是哪一對反射面；檢查真空度是否維持在 1e−6 mbar 以下、長時間是否上升。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log the cooldown curve and the steady-state stage temperatures and compare with the heat-load model; measure the bandpass on a flat load, Fourier-analyse the ripple to get its period Δν and locate the reflecting pair from L = c/(2Δν); check that the vacuum stays below 1e−6 mbar and does not rise over time. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a474-v12-28","title":"低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「前端低溫恆溫器與真空窗」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Front-end cryostat and vacuum window” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"真空微漏讓空氣在 4 K 表面低溫泵吸，先是平台溫度緩升，接著水氣在真空窗內結霜造成損耗，雜訊溫度在幾週內逐步惡化；低溫機氦氣污染則讓 4 K 級漂到 5 K 以上，SIS 性能同時衰退。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A small vacuum leak lets air cryopump onto the 4 K surfaces, the stage temperature creeps up, then water frosts the inside of the window and adds loss, and the noise temperature degrades over weeks; helium contamination of the cryocooler drifts the 4 K stage above 5 K and the SIS performance falls with it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：真空窗與紅外濾片必須在該波段低損耗，但窗與饋源之間任何殘餘反射都會形成駐波，使頻帶響應出現週期性漣波，週期為 c/(2L)，L 是兩反射面的間距。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The vacuum window and infrared filter must be low-loss in band, yet any residual reflection between the window and the feed forms a standing wave that imprints periodic ripple on the bandpass with period c/(2L), L being the spacing of the two reflecting surfaces.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「真空抽得夠低，低溫腔內就沒有熱負載。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A good enough vacuum means there is no heat load into the cryostat.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"真空微漏讓空氣在 4 K 表面低溫泵吸，先是平台溫度緩升，接著水氣在真空窗內結霜造成損耗，雜訊溫度在幾週內逐步惡化；低溫機氦氣污染則讓 4 K 級漂到 5 K 以上，SIS 性能同時衰退。","textEn":"A small vacuum leak lets air cryopump onto the 4 K surfaces, the stage temperature creeps up, then water frosts the inside of the window and adds loss, and the noise temperature degrades over weeks; helium contamination of the cryocooler drifts the 4 K stage above 5 K and the SIS performance falls with it.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低溫整合：熱負載、真空窗與駐波」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cryogenic integration: heat loads, windows and standing waves\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","真空微漏讓空氣在 4 K 表面低溫泵吸，先是平台溫度緩升，接著水氣在真空窗內結霜造成損耗，雜訊溫度在幾週內逐步惡化。","通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A small vacuum leak lets air cryopump onto the 4 K surfaces, the stage temperature creeps up, then water frosts the inside of the window and adds loss, and the noise temperature degrades over weeks.","Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope."],"answer":1,"explanation":"真空微漏讓空氣在 4 K 表面低溫泵吸，先是平台溫度緩升，接著水氣在真空窗內結霜造成損耗，雜訊溫度在幾週內逐步惡化；低溫機氦氣污染則讓 4 K 級漂到 5 K 以上，SIS 性能同時衰退。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small vacuum leak lets air cryopump onto the 4 K surfaces, the stage temperature creeps up, then water frosts the inside of the window and adds loss, and the noise temperature degrades over weeks; helium contamination of the cryocooler drifts the 4 K stage above 5 K and the SIS performance falls with it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a474-v12-29","title":"驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」如何決定電波望遠鏡低雜訊接收機的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Receiver acceptance and performance record” determines the key performance of “Radio-telescope low-noise receivers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"一個接收機卡匣的驗收包含：各本振設定下 T_rx 對頻率曲線、邊帶分離比、中頻通帶平坦度、Allan 穩定度、波束方向圖與交叉極化、雜散訊號；上望遠鏡後再用行星量孔徑效率、量各波段的指向與焦點偏移、量 Tsys 對可降水量的關係。交接文件必須有校正表、T_cal、相位中心位置與操作限制，否則實驗室合格的接收機在望遠鏡上無法重現相同靈敏度。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Acceptance of a receiver cartridge covers T_rx versus frequency at each LO setting, sideband-separation ratio, IF passband flatness, Allan stability, beam pattern with cross-polarisation and spurious signals; on the telescope it continues with aperture efficiency from planets, pointing and focus offsets per band and Tsys versus precipitable water vapour. The handoff record must contain calibration tables, T_cal, phase-centre positions and operating limits, otherwise a receiver that passed in the lab cannot reproduce the same sensitivity on the telescope. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Receiver acceptance and performance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學規格：T_rx 在 80% 頻帶內 ≤ 80 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching specification: T_rx ≤ 80 K over 80% of the band.","failure":"常見誤解：「通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Receiver acceptance and performance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-29-k1","title":"驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接","titleEn":"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff","text":"一個接收機卡匣的驗收包含：各本振設定下 T_rx 對頻率曲線、邊帶分離比、中頻通帶平坦度、Allan 穩定度、波束方向圖與交叉極化、雜散訊號；上望遠鏡後再用行星量孔徑效率、量各波段的指向與焦點偏移、量 Tsys 對可降水量的關係。交接文件必須有校正表、T_cal、相位中心位置與操作限制，否則實驗室合格的接收機在望遠鏡上無法重現相同靈敏度。","textEn":"Acceptance of a receiver cartridge covers T_rx versus frequency at each LO setting, sideband-separation ratio, IF passband flatness, Allan stability, beam pattern with cross-polarisation and spurious signals; on the telescope it continues with aperture efficiency from planets, pointing and focus offsets per band and Tsys versus precipitable water vapour. The handoff record must contain calibration tables, T_cal, phase-centre positions and operating limits, otherwise a receiver that passed in the lab cannot reproduce the same sensitivity on the telescope.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff\" is correct?","options":["通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。","雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","一個接收機卡匣的驗收包含：各本振設定下 T_rx 對頻率曲線、邊帶分離比、中頻通帶平坦度、Allan 穩定度、波束方向圖與交叉極化、雜散訊號。"],"optionsEn":["Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope.","Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","Acceptance of a receiver cartridge covers T_rx versus frequency at each LO setting, sideband-separation ratio, IF passband flatness, Allan stability, beam pattern with cross-polarisation and spurious signals."],"answer":2,"explanation":"一個接收機卡匣的驗收包含：各本振設定下 T_rx 對頻率曲線、邊帶分離比、中頻通帶平坦度、Allan 穩定度、波束方向圖與交叉極化、雜散訊號；上望遠鏡後再用行星量孔徑效率、量各波段的指向與焦點偏移、量 Tsys 對可降水量的關係。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Acceptance of a receiver cartridge covers T_rx versus frequency at each LO setting, sideband-separation ratio, IF passband flatness, Allan stability, beam pattern with cross-polarisation and spurious signals; on the telescope it continues with aperture efficiency from planets, pointing and focus offsets per band and Tsys versus precipitable water vapour. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a474-v12-30","title":"驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Receiver acceptance and performance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學規格：T_rx 在 80% 頻帶內 ≤ 80 K。雙邊帶分離接收機若影像抑制只有 10 dB，影像邊帶 10% 的天空雜訊（例如 50 K）會洩漏成 5 K 的額外 Tsys；交叉極化 −20 dB 代表 1% 的洩漏，對 1% 偏振的天體而言洩漏與訊號同量級，必須做 D-term 校正。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching specification: T_rx ≤ 80 K over 80% of the band. A sideband-separating receiver with only 10 dB image rejection leaks 10% of the image-band sky noise (say 50 K) as 5 K of extra Tsys; −20 dB cross-polarisation means 1% leakage, equal to the signal for a 1% polarised source, so D-term calibration is mandatory. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在測試平台跑完整個驗收矩陣（負載 Y 因子、波束掃描器、向量網路分析儀量中頻），再做上機試觀測：行星效率、類星體指向、Tsys 對仰角；產出含 T_rx 曲線、Allan 圖與效率表的性能紀錄，並在每次維修後重跑縮減版回歸測試。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run the full acceptance matrix on the test set (load Y-factor, beam scanner, vector network analyser for the IF), then commission on sky with planet efficiencies, quasar pointing and Tsys versus elevation; produce a performance record with T_rx curves, Allan plots and an efficiency table, and rerun a reduced regression set after every repair.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學規格：T_rx 在 80% 頻帶內 ≤ 80 K。雙邊帶分離接收機若影像抑制只有 10 dB，影像邊帶 10% 的天空雜訊（例如 50 K）會洩漏成 5 K 的額外 Tsys；交叉極化 −20 dB 代表 1% 的洩漏，對 1% 偏振的天體而言洩漏與訊號同量級，必須做 D-term 校正。","textEn":"Teaching specification: T_rx ≤ 80 K over 80% of the band. A sideband-separating receiver with only 10 dB image rejection leaks 10% of the image-band sky noise (say 50 K) as 5 K of extra Tsys; −20 dB cross-polarisation means 1% leakage, equal to the signal for a 1% polarised source, so D-term calibration is mandatory.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["教學規格：T_rx 在 80% 頻帶內 ≤ 80 K。","增加後級放大器的增益可以降低系統雜訊溫度。","雜訊二極體校正一次之後就永遠有效。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching specification: T_rx ≤ 80 K over 80% of the band.","Adding gain in later amplifier stages lowers the system noise temperature.","Once the noise diode has been calibrated it stays valid forever."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學規格：T_rx 在 80% 頻帶內 ≤ 80 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching specification: T_rx ≤ 80 K over 80% of the band. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a474-v12-31","title":"驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Receiver acceptance and performance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在測試平台跑完整個驗收矩陣（負載 Y 因子、波束掃描器、向量網路分析儀量中頻），再做上機試觀測：行星效率、類星體指向、Tsys 對仰角；產出含 T_rx 曲線、Allan 圖與效率表的性能紀錄，並在每次維修後重跑縮減版回歸測試。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run the full acceptance matrix on the test set (load Y-factor, beam scanner, vector network analyser for the IF), then commission on sky with planet efficiencies, quasar pointing and Tsys versus elevation; produce a performance record with T_rx curves, Allan plots and an efficiency table, and rerun a reduced regression set after every repair. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：實驗室合格的接收機上機後 Tsys 偏高，原因可能是本振雜散、相位中心沒對到焦點，或校正表沒有一起更新；若只核對實驗室報告而沒有上機驗證，這類問題會留到科學資料才被發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A receiver that passed in the lab shows elevated Tsys on the telescope because of an LO spur, a phase centre not at the focus or calibration tables that were not updated together; if acceptance only checks the lab report without on-sky verification, such problems surface only in science data.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在測試平台跑完整個驗收矩陣（負載 Y 因子、波束掃描器、向量網路分析儀量中頻），再做上機試觀測：行星效率、類星體指向、Tsys 對仰角；產出含 T_rx 曲線、Allan 圖與效率表的性能紀錄，並在每次維修後重跑縮減版回歸測試。","textEn":"Run the full acceptance matrix on the test set (load Y-factor, beam scanner, vector network analyser for the IF), then commission on sky with planet efficiencies, quasar pointing and Tsys versus elevation; produce a performance record with T_rx curves, Allan plots and an efficiency table, and rerun a reduced regression set after every repair.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在測試平台跑完整個驗收矩陣（負載 Y 因子、波束掃描器、向量網路分析儀量中頻），再做上機試觀測：行星效率、類星體指向、Tsys 對仰角。","積分時間越長，靈敏度一定越好。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run the full acceptance matrix on the test set (load Y-factor, beam scanner, vector network analyser for the IF), then commission on sky with planet efficiencies, quasar pointing and Tsys versus elevation.","Longer integration always gives better sensitivity."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在測試平台跑完整個驗收矩陣（負載 Y 因子、波束掃描器、向量網路分析儀量中頻），再做上機試觀測：行星效率、類星體指向、Tsys 對仰角；產出含 T_rx 曲線、Allan 圖與效率表的性能紀錄，並在每次維修後重跑縮減版回歸測試。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run the full acceptance matrix on the test set (load Y-factor, beam scanner, vector network analyser for the IF), then commission on sky with planet efficiencies, quasar pointing and Tsys versus elevation; produce a performance record with T_rx curves, Allan plots and an efficiency table, and rerun a reduced regression set after every repair. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a474-v12-32","title":"驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"prerequisiteIds":["a474-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「接收機驗收與性能紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Receiver acceptance and performance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"實驗室合格的接收機上機後 Tsys 偏高，原因可能是本振雜散、相位中心沒對到焦點，或校正表沒有一起更新；若只核對實驗室報告而沒有上機驗證，這類問題會留到科學資料才被發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A receiver that passed in the lab shows elevated Tsys on the telescope because of an LO spur, a phase centre not at the focus or calibration tables that were not updated together; if acceptance only checks the lab report without on-sky verification, such problems surface only in science data. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件必須有校正表、T_cal、相位中心位置與操作限制，否則實驗室合格的接收機在望遠鏡上無法重現相同靈敏度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record must contain calibration tables, T_cal, phase-centre positions and operating limits, otherwise a receiver that passed in the lab cannot reproduce the same sensitivity on the telescope.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「通過實驗室雜訊測試就代表望遠鏡上也會達到相同靈敏度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Passing the laboratory noise test guarantees the same sensitivity on the telescope.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a474-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"實驗室合格的接收機上機後 Tsys 偏高，原因可能是本振雜散、相位中心沒對到焦點，或校正表沒有一起更新；若只核對實驗室報告而沒有上機驗證，這類問題會留到科學資料才被發現。","textEn":"A receiver that passed in the lab shows elevated Tsys on the telescope because of an LO spur, a phase centre not at the focus or calibration tables that were not updated together; if acceptance only checks the lab report without on-sky verification, such problems surface only in science data.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]},{"id":"a474-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「驗收測試矩陣、上機驗證與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Acceptance matrix, on-telescope verification and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","雜訊溫度就是接收機元件的實際物理溫度。","實驗室合格的接收機上機後 Tsys 偏高，原因可能是本振雜散、相位中心沒對到焦點，或校正表沒有一起更新。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Noise temperature is the actual physical temperature of the receiver parts.","A receiver that passed in the lab shows elevated Tsys on the telescope because of an LO spur, a phase centre not at the focus or calibration tables that were not updated together."],"answer":2,"explanation":"實驗室合格的接收機上機後 Tsys 偏高，原因可能是本振雜散、相位中心沒對到焦點，或校正表沒有一起更新；若只核對實驗室報告而沒有上機驗證，這類問題會留到科學資料才被發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A receiver that passed in the lab shows elevated Tsys on the telescope because of an LO spur, a phase centre not at the focus or calibration tables that were not updated together; if acceptance only checks the lab report without on-sky verification, such problems surface only in science data. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-receivers","v12o-gbt-receivers-docs","v12o-lnf-lnc4-8f-lg","v12o-asiaa-band1-release"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
